  storyChapters:
  - id: chapter_1
    title: "Ch\u01B0\u01A1ng 1 - Ng\u1ECDn L\u1EEDa D\u01B0\u1EDBi M\u1EB7t Tr\u1EDDi
      Sa M\u1EA1c"
    summary: "Lunen l\u1EA7n theo chi\u1EBFc v\xF2ng ng\u1ECDc t\u1EDBi bi\xEAn gi\u1EDBi
      Akherat, g\u1EB7p Elio, b\u1ECB cu\u1ED1n v\xE0o \xE2m m\u01B0u truy s\xE1t
      v\u01B0\u01A1ng t\u1EED, ch\u1EE9ng ki\u1EBFn bi\u1EBFn c\u1ED1 c\u1EE7a H\u1ECFa
      th\u1EA7n Aurelian v\xE0 s\u1EF1 ra \u0111\u1EDDi c\u1EE7a v\u1ECB vua con
      ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn c\u1EE7a Akherat."
    background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
    introDialogue:
      id: chapter_1_intro
      title: "M\u1EDF \u0111\u1EA7u - R\u1EEBng bi\xEAn gi\u1EDBi Akherat"
      summary: "Lunen v\xE0 Tinh Linh l\u1EA7n theo chi\u1EBFc v\xF2ng ng\u1ECDc,
        b\u1ECB m\u1ED9t con m\xE8o \u0111en c\u01B0\u1EDBp v\xF2ng v\xE0 ch\u1EA1m
        m\u1EB7t thi\u1EBFu ni\xEAn b\xED \u1EA9n."
      beats:
      - speaker: 
        text: "Ch\u01B0\u01A1ng 1: Quest: Ng\u1ECDn L\u1EEDa D\u01B0\u1EDBi M\u1EB7t
          Tr\u1EDDi Sa M\u1EA1c\nC\u1EA3nh 1: R\u1EEBng bi\xEAn gi\u1EDBi Akherat"
        background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
        leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        dimLeft: 1
        dimRight: 1
        layoutMode: 0
        instantLayout: 0
        castActions: []
        characterPlacements: []
        characterMovements: []
        characterVisuals: []
        onBeatStarted:
          m_PersistentCalls:
            m_Calls: []
      - speaker: 
        text: "\xC1nh m\u1EB7t tr\u1EDDi xuy\xEAn qua nh\u1EEFng t\xE1n c\xE2y cao,
          v\u1EE1 th\xE0nh t\u1EEBng m\u1EA3ng s\xE1ng v\xE0ng nh\u1EA1t tr\xEAn
          n\u1EC1n \u0111\u1EA5t.\nNh\u1EEFng th\xE2n c\xE2y c\u1ED5 th\u1EE5 ph\u1EE7
          \u0111\u1EA7y r\xEAu kh\xF4 \u0111\u1EE9ng im l\xECm gi\u1EEFa m\xE0n b\u1EE5i
          m\u1ECFng, thi tho\u1EA3ng ch\u1EC9 rung l\xEAn khi m\u1ED9t c\u01A1n gi\xF3
          n\xF3ng l\u01B0\u1EDBt qua."
        background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
        leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        dimLeft: 1
        dimRight: 1
        layoutMode: 0
        instantLayout: 0
        castActions: []
        characterPlacements: []
        characterMovements: []
        characterVisuals: []
        onBeatStarted:
          m_PersistentCalls:
            m_Calls: []
      - speaker: 
        text: "Xa h\u01A1n n\u1EEFa, th\u1EA5p tho\xE1ng sau nh\u1EEFng ng\u1ECDn
          c\xE2y l\xE0 nh\u1EEFng d\xE3y n\xFAi \u0111\xE1 \u0111\u1ECF\nLunen ch\u1EADm
          r\xE3i b\u01B0\u1EDBc tr\xEAn con \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng m\xF2n.\nChi\u1EBFc
          v\xF2ng ng\u1ECDc n\u1EB1m y\xEAn tr\xEAn c\u1ED5 tay c\u1EADu, ph\u1EA3n
          chi\u1EBFu \xE1nh n\u1EAFng th\xE0nh m\u1ED9t v\u1EC7t s\xE1ng xanh nh\u1EA1t.\nTinh
          linh nh\u1ECF bay b\xEAn c\u1EA1nh, hai tay ch\u1ED1ng sau \u0111\u1EA7u."
        background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
        leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        dimLeft: 1
        dimRight: 1
        layoutMode: 0
        instantLayout: 0
        castActions: []
        characterPlacements: []
        characterMovements: []
        characterVisuals: []
        onBeatStarted:
          m_PersistentCalls:
            m_Calls: []
      - speaker: 
        text: "Ch\xFAng ta \u0111\xE3 \u0111i theo ph\u1EA3n \u1EE9ng c\u1EE7a chi\u1EBFc
          v\xF2ng ng\u1ECDc su\u1ED1t ba ng\xE0y r\u1ED3i.\nC\u1EADu c\xF3 ch\u1EAFc
          t\xEDn hi\u1EC7u ph\xE1t ra t\u1EEB h\u01B0\u1EDBng n\xE0y kh\xF4ng?"
        background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
        leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        dimLeft: 1
        dimRight: 1
        layoutMode: 0
        instantLayout: 0
        castActions: []
        characterPlacements: []
        characterMovements: []
        characterVisuals: []
        onBeatStarted:
          m_PersistentCalls:
            m_Calls: []
      - speaker: 
        text: "Lunen kh\xF4ng tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi ngay.\nC\u1EADu \u0111\u01B0a tay
          l\xEAn, kh\u1EBD ch\u1EA1m v\xE0o chi\u1EBFc v\xF2ng.\nM\u1EB7t ng\u1ECDc
          l\u1EA1nh ng\u1EAFt.\nNh\u01B0ng \u1EDF s\xE2u b\xEAn trong n\xF3, m\u1ED9t
          tia s\xE1ng m\u1EDD \u0111ang ch\u1EDBp t\u1EAFt."
        background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
        leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        dimLeft: 1
        dimRight: 1
        layoutMode: 0
        instantLayout: 0
        castActions: []
        characterPlacements: []
        characterMovements: []
        characterVisuals: []
        onBeatStarted:
          m_PersistentCalls:
            m_Calls: []
      - speaker: Lunen
        text: "Tin t\u1EDB \u0111i , t\u1EDB c\u1EA3m nh\u1EADn c\xF3 g\xEC \u0111\xF3
          t\u1EEB vi\xEAn ng\u1ECDc n\xE0y d\u1EABn d\u1EAFt t\u1EDB theo h\u01B0\u1EDBng
          n\xE0y m\xE0"
        background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
        leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        dimLeft: 0
        dimRight: 1
        layoutMode: 0
        instantLayout: 0
        castActions: []
        characterPlacements: []
        characterMovements: []
        characterVisuals: []
        onBeatStarted:
          m_PersistentCalls:
            m_Calls: []
      - speaker: Tinh Linh
        text: "Th\u1EADt k\u1EF3 l\u1EA1, n\u01A1i n\xE0y c\u1EE9 nh\u01B0 m\xEA
          cung v\u1EADy, ch\xFAng ta \u0111i m\xE3i r\u1ED3i kh\xF4ng th\u1EA5y l\u1ED1i
          ra \u1EDF \u0111\xE2u c\u1EA3, khu r\u1EEBng n\xE0y th\u1EADt k\u1EF3 l\u1EA1
          \u2026."
        background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
        leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        dimLeft: 0
        dimRight: 1
        layoutMode: 0
        instantLayout: 0
        castActions: []
        characterPlacements: []
        characterMovements: []
        characterVisuals: []
        onBeatStarted:
          m_PersistentCalls:
            m_Calls: []
      - speaker: Lunen
        text: "( Th\u1EA7m ngh\u0129 ) th\u1EE9 n\xE0y th\u1EADt k\u1EF3 l\u1EA1
          ,n\xF3 c\u1EE9 nh\u01B0 c\xF3 ma l\u1EF1c th\xF4i th\xFAc m\xECnh ph\u1EA3i
          \u0111i v\u1EC1 h\u01B0\u1EDBng tr\u01B0\u1EDBc"
        background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
        leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        dimLeft: 0
        dimRight: 1
        layoutMode: 0
        instantLayout: 0
        castActions: []
        characterPlacements: []
        characterMovements: []
        characterVisuals: []
        onBeatStarted:
          m_PersistentCalls:
            m_Calls: []
      - speaker: 
        text: "M\u1ED9t ti\u1EBFng \u0111\u1ED9ng r\u1EA5t kh\u1EBD vang l\xEAn t\u1EEB
          b\u1EE5i c\xE2y b\xEAn tr\xE1i.\nX\xE0o x\u1EA1c.\nC\u1EA3 hai c\xF9ng
          d\u1EEBng l\u1EA1i.\nTinh linh nghi\xEAng \u0111\u1EA7u."
        background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
        leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        dimLeft: 1
        dimRight: 1
        layoutMode: 0
        instantLayout: 0
        castActions: []
        characterPlacements: []
        characterMovements: []
        characterVisuals: []
        onBeatStarted:
          m_PersistentCalls:
            m_Calls: []
      - speaker: Tinh Linh
        text: "...C\u1EADu c\xF3 nghe th\u1EA5y kh\xF4ng?"
        background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
        leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        dimLeft: 0
        dimRight: 1
        layoutMode: 0
        instantLayout: 0
        castActions: []
        characterPlacements: []
        characterMovements: []
        characterVisuals: []
        onBeatStarted:
          m_PersistentCalls:
            m_Calls: []
      - speaker: 
        text: "Lunen nh\xECn v\u1EC1 ph\xEDa b\u1EE5i c\xE2y."
        background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
        leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        dimLeft: 1
        dimRight: 1
        layoutMode: 0
        instantLayout: 0
        castActions: []
        characterPlacements: []
        characterMovements: []
        characterVisuals: []
        onBeatStarted:
          m_PersistentCalls:
            m_Calls: []
      - speaker: 
        text: "Kh\xF4ng c\xF3 g\xEC.\nC\u1EADu v\u1EEBa \u0111\u1ECBnh b\u01B0\u1EDBc
          ti\u1EBFp\u2014\nM\u1ED9t b\xF3ng \u0111en b\u1EA5t ng\u1EDD lao v\u1EE5t
          ra kh\u1ECFi b\u1EE5i r\u1EADm."
        background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
        leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        dimLeft: 1
        dimRight: 1
        layoutMode: 0
        instantLayout: 0
        castActions: []
        characterPlacements: []
        characterMovements: []
        characterVisuals: []
        onBeatStarted:
          m_PersistentCalls:
            m_Calls: []
      - speaker: Tinh Linh
        text: "\xC1 !"
        background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
        leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        dimLeft: 0
        dimRight: 1
        layoutMode: 0
        instantLayout: 0
        castActions: []
        characterPlacements: []
        characterMovements: []
        characterVisuals: []
        onBeatStarted:
          m_PersistentCalls:
            m_Calls: []
      - speaker: 
        text: "M\u1ED9t th\u1EE9 g\xEC \u0111\xF3 s\u01B0\u1EE3t qua ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
          Lunen.\nC\u1EADu ch\u1EC9 k\u1ECBp c\u1EA3m nh\u1EADn m\u1ED9t lu\u1ED3ng
          gi\xF3 nh\u1ECF tr\xEAn c\u1ED5 tay.\nR\u1ED3i \u2014 - - Chi\u1EBFc v\xF2ng
          bi\u1EBFn m\u1EA5t.\nLunen c\xFAi xu\u1ED1ng nh\xECn c\u1ED5 tay tr\u1ED1ng
          kh\xF4ng."
        background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
        leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        dimLeft: 1
        dimRight: 1
        layoutMode: 0
        instantLayout: 0
        castActions: []
        characterPlacements: []
        characterMovements: []
        characterVisuals: []
        onBeatStarted:
          m_PersistentCalls:
            m_Calls: []
      - speaker: Tinh Linh & Lunen
        text: "CHI\u1EBEC V\xD2NG !!!!!!!"
        background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
        leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        dimLeft: 1
        dimRight: 0
        layoutMode: 0
        instantLayout: 0
        castActions: []
        characterPlacements: []
        characterMovements: []
        characterVisuals: []
        onBeatStarted:
          m_PersistentCalls:
            m_Calls: []
      - speaker: 
        text: "B\xF3ng \u0111en \u0111\xE3 ch\u1EA1y xa.\nM\u1ED9t c\xE1i \u0111u\xF4i
          \u0111en tho\xE1ng bi\u1EBFn m\u1EA5t sau nh\u1EEFng th\xE2n c\xE2y.\nLunen
          l\u1EADp t\u1EE9c quay ng\u01B0\u1EDDi."
        background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
        leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        dimLeft: 1
        dimRight: 1
        layoutMode: 0
        instantLayout: 0
        castActions: []
        characterPlacements: []
        characterMovements: []
        characterVisuals: []
        onBeatStarted:
          m_PersistentCalls:
            m_Calls: []
      - speaker: Lunen
        text: "\u0110u\u1ED5i theo!"
        background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
        leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        dimLeft: 0
        dimRight: 1
        layoutMode: 0
        instantLayout: 0
        castActions: []
        characterPlacements: []
        characterMovements: []
        characterVisuals: []
        onBeatStarted:
          m_PersistentCalls:
            m_Calls: []
      - speaker: 
        text: "Cu\u1ED9c truy \u0111u\u1ED5i k\xE9o d\xE0i \u0111\u1EBFn t\u1EADn
          m\u1ED9t kho\u1EA3ng r\u1EEBng th\u01B0a. B\xF3ng \u0111en \u0111\u1ED9t
          nhi\xEAn bi\u1EBFn m\u1EA5t sau m\u1ED9t t\xE1n c\xE2y l\u1EDBn.\nLunen
          d\u1EEBng l\u1EA1i.\nTinh linh bay t\u1EDBi b\xEAn c\u1EA1nh, th\u1EDF
          h\u1ED5n h\u1EC3n."
        background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
        leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        dimLeft: 1
        dimRight: 1
        layoutMode: 0
        instantLayout: 0
        castActions: []
        characterPlacements: []
        characterMovements: []
        characterVisuals: []
        onBeatStarted:
          m_PersistentCalls:
            m_Calls: []
      - speaker: Tinh Linh
        text: "\u0110\u1EEBng n\xF3i v\u1EDBi t\u1EDB l\xE0 m\u1EA5t d\u1EA5u r\u1ED3i
          nh\xE9..."
        background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
        leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        dimLeft: 0
        dimRight: 1
        layoutMode: 0
        instantLayout: 0
        castActions: []
        characterPlacements: []
        characterMovements: []
        characterVisuals: []
        onBeatStarted:
          m_PersistentCalls:
            m_Calls: []
      - speaker: 
        text: "Lunen kh\xF4ng tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi. C\u1EADu nh\xECn nh\u1EEFng chi\u1EBFc
          l\xE1 ph\xEDa tr\u01B0\u1EDBc. M\u1ED9t c\u01A1n gi\xF3 nh\u1EB9 th\u1ED5i
          qua. T\xE1n c\xE2y l\u1EDBn rung l\xEAn. Lunen v\xE0 tinh linh cu\u1ED1i
          c\xF9ng c\u0169ng \u0111u\u1ED5i \u0111\u1EBFn m\u1ED9t kho\u1EA3ng r\u1EEBng
          t\u01B0\u01A1ng \u0111\u1ED1i y\xEAn t\u0129nh. B\xF3ng \u0111en v\u1EEBa
          r\u1ED3i \u0111\xE3 bi\u1EBFn m\u1EA5t sau m\u1ED9t t\xE1n c\xE2y l\u1EDBn.
          C\u1EA3 hai gi\u1EA3m t\u1ED1c \u0111\u1ED9, c\u1EA9n th\u1EADn ti\u1EBFn
          l\u1EA1i g\u1EA7n."
        background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
        leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        dimLeft: 1
        dimRight: 1
        layoutMode: 0
        instantLayout: 0
        castActions: []
        characterPlacements: []
        characterMovements: []
        characterVisuals: []
        onBeatStarted:
          m_PersistentCalls:
            m_Calls: []
      - speaker: 
        text: "Lunen v\xE0 tinh linh t\u1EEB t\u1EEB ti\u1EBFn \u0111\u1EBFn sau
          t\xE1n c\xE2y. Con m\xE8o \u0111en \u0111ang n\u1EB1m tr\xEAn vai ch\xE0ng
          trai tr\u1EBB, chi\u1EBFc v\xF2ng ng\u1ECDc v\u1EABn m\u1EAFc tr\xEAn c\u1ED5
          n\xF3."
        background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
        leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        dimLeft: 1
        dimRight: 1
        layoutMode: 0
        instantLayout: 0
        castActions: []
        characterPlacements: []
        characterMovements: []
        characterVisuals: []
        onBeatStarted:
          m_PersistentCalls:
            m_Calls: []
      - speaker: 
        text: "Tinh linh v\u1EEBa \u0111\u1ECBnh \u0111\u01B0a tay ra hi\u1EC7u cho
          Lunen ti\u1EBFn th\xEAm m\u1ED9t b\u01B0\u1EDBc th\xEC m\u0169i gi\xE0y
          c\u1EE7a c\u1EADu v\xF4 t\xECnh ch\u1EA1m ph\u1EA3i m\u1ED9t c\xE0nh c\xE2y
          kh\xF4."
        background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
        leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        dimLeft: 1
        dimRight: 1
        layoutMode: 0
        instantLayout: 0
        castActions: []
        characterPlacements: []
        characterMovements: []
        characterVisuals: []
        onBeatStarted:
          m_PersistentCalls:
            m_Calls: []
      - speaker: 
        text: "R\u1EAFc."
        background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
        leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        dimLeft: 1
        dimRight: 1
        layoutMode: 0
        instantLayout: 0
        castActions: []
        characterPlacements: []
        characterMovements: []
        characterVisuals: []
        onBeatStarted:
          m_PersistentCalls:
            m_Calls: []
      - speaker: 
        text: "\xC2m thanh nh\u1ECF \u0111\u1EBFn m\u1EE9c g\u1EA7n nh\u01B0 b\u1ECB
          nu\u1ED1t ch\u1EEDng b\u1EDFi ti\u1EBFng gi\xF3, nh\u01B0ng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
          thi\u1EBFu ni\xEAn d\u01B0\u1EDBi g\u1ED1c c\xE2y l\u1EADp t\u1EE9c m\u1EDF
          m\u1EAFt.\nCh\u1EC9 trong kho\u1EA3nh kh\u1EAFc, v\u1EBB l\u01A1 \u0111\xE3ng
          tr\xEAn khu\xF4n m\u1EB7t bi\u1EBFn m\u1EA5t ho\xE0n to\xE0n."
