      - speaker: 
        text: "C\u1EADu b\u1EADt d\u1EADy, con m\xE8o tr\xEAn vai gi\u1EADt m\xECnh
          nh\u1EA3y xu\u1ED1ng \u0111\u1EA5t. B\xE0n tay c\u1EADu \u0111\u1ED3ng
          th\u1EDDi ch\u1ED9p l\u1EA5y v\u0169 kh\xED \u0111\u1EB7t b\xEAn c\u1EA1nh.
          M\u1ED9t lu\u1ED3ng l\u1EEDa \u0111\u1ECF s\u1EABm l\u1EADp t\u1EE9c b\xF9ng
          l\xEAn d\u1ECDc theo l\u01B0\u1EE1i v\u0169 kh\xED, \xE1nh s\xE1ng n\xF3ng
          r\u1EF1c ph\u1EA3n chi\u1EBFu tr\xEAn g\u01B0\u01A1ng m\u1EB7t v\u1ED1n
          c\xF2n mang n\xE9t tr\u1EBB tu\u1ED5i. C\u1EADu xoay ng\u01B0\u1EDDi v\u1EC1
          ph\xEDa t\xE1n c\xE2y, \xE1nh m\u1EAFt s\u1EAFc l\u1EA1nh kh\xF3a ch\u1EB7t
          v\u1ECB tr\xED c\u1EE7a Lunen v\xE0 tinh linh."
