      - speaker: 
        text: "Lunen \u0111\u1EE1 m\u1ED9t nh\xE1t ch\xE9m r\u1ED3i l\u1EADp t\u1EE9c
          ph\u1EA3n c\xF4ng. Hai l\u01B0\u1EE1i v\u0169 kh\xED va v\xE0o nhau, \xE2m
          thanh kim lo\u1EA1i vang v\u1ECDng gi\u1EEFa r\u1EEBng. Thi\u1EBFu ni\xEAn
          tr\u01B0\u1EE3t v\u1EC1 ph\xEDa sau v\xE0i b\u01B0\u1EDBc nh\u01B0ng nhanh
          ch\xF3ng l\u1EA5y l\u1EA1i th\u0103ng b\u1EB1ng v\xE0 ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c
          \xE1p s\xE1t.\nCu\u1ED9c giao tranh ch\u1EC9 k\xE9o d\xE0i trong m\u1ED9t
          kho\u1EA3ng th\u1EDDi gian ng\u1EAFn."
