      - speaker: 
        text: "Thi\u1EBFu ni\xEAn r\u1EA5t m\u1EA1nh, nh\u01B0ng Lunen nhanh ch\xF3ng
          b\u1EAFt \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c nh\u1ECBp t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng c\u1EE7a c\u1EADu.
