      - speaker: 
        text: "Con m\xE8o gi\u1EADt m\xECnh b\u1ECF ch\u1EA1y.\nN\xF3 ph\xF3ng qua
          n\u1EC1n \u0111\u1EA5t, l\xE1ch gi\u1EEFa hai th\xE2n c\xE2y r\u1ED3i b\u1EA5t
