      - speaker: Tinh Linh
        text: "Con m\xE8o n\xE0y c\u01B0\u1EDBp \u0111\u1ED3 c\u1EE7a ch\xFAng t\xF4i
          tr\u01B0\u1EDBc! Chi\u1EBFc v\xF2ng tr\xEAn c\u1ED5 n\xF3 l\xE0 c\u1EE7a
          Lunen!"
        background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
        leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
