      - speaker: 
        text: "Thi\u1EBFu ni\xEAn kh\u1EF1ng l\u1EA1i. \xC1nh m\u1EAFt c\u1EADu chuy\u1EC3n
          xu\u1ED1ng chi\u1EBFc v\xF2ng. R\u1ED3i sang Lunen.\nSau c\xF9ng, c\u1EADu
          nh\xECn con m\xE8o \u0111ang v\xF4 t\u01B0 li\u1EBFm ch\xE2n tr\xEAn vai
          m\xECnh.\nM\u1ED9t kho\u1EA3ng l\u1EB7ng k\xE9o d\xE0i."
