      - speaker: 
        text: "Hai tai n\xF3 l\u1EADp t\u1EE9c c\u1EE5p xu\u1ED1ng.\nThi\u1EBFu ni\xEAn
          ch\u1EC9 v\u1EC1 ph\xEDa Lunen."
