          m_PersistentCalls:
            m_Calls: []
      - speaker: 
        text: "D\xE1ng v\u1EBB ngh\u1ECBch ng\u1EE3m ban n\xE3y ho\xE0n to\xE0n bi\u1EBFn
          m\u1EA5t. N\xF3 c\xFAi th\u1EA5p \u0111\u1EA7u, nh\u1EB9 nh\xE0ng \u0111\u1EB7t
          chi\u1EBFc v\xF2ng xu\u1ED1ng \u0111\u1EA5t r\u1ED3i ph\xE1t ra m\u1ED9t
          ti\u1EBFng k\xEAu nh\u1ECF."
