      - speaker: 
        text: "Tinh linh ngh\u1EB9n l\u1EDDi, c\xF2n Lunen kh\xF4ng nh\u1ECBn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
          b\u1EADt c\u01B0\u1EDDi. Thi\u1EBFu ni\xEAn c\u0169ng kh\u1EBD cong kh\xF3e
          m\xF4i. S\u1EF1 c\u0103ng th\u1EB3ng gi\u1EEFa h\u1ECD cu\u1ED1i c\xF9ng
          \u0111\xE3 th\u1EF1c s\u1EF1 tan \u0111i.\nC\u1EADu nh\xECn Lunen th\xEAm
          m\u1ED9t l\xFAc, r\u1ED3i \xE1nh m\u1EAFt chuy\u1EC3n sang thanh v\u0169
          kh\xED c\u1EE7a m\xECnh.\nNh\u01B0ng ngay l\xFAc \u0111\xF3, m\u1ED9t ti\u1EBFng
          g\u1EA7m tr\u1EA7m \u0111\u1EE5c b\u1EA5t ng\u1EDD vang l\xEAn t\u1EEB
          s\xE2u trong khu r\u1EEBng."
        background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
        leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
        dimLeft: 1
        dimRight: 1
        layoutMode: 0
