          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: "C\u1EA3nh 1"
          text: "R\u1EEBng bi\xEAn gi\u1EDBi Akherat"
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 0
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: 
          text: "\xC1nh m\u1EB7t tr\u1EDDi xuy\xEAn qua nh\u1EEFng t\xE1n c\xE2y
            cao, v\u1EE1 th\xE0nh t\u1EEBng m\u1EA3ng s\xE1ng v\xE0ng nh\u1EA1t tr\xEAn
            n\u1EC1n \u0111\u1EA5t.\nNh\u1EEFng th\xE2n c\xE2y c\u1ED5 th\u1EE5 ph\u1EE7
            \u0111\u1EA7y r\xEAu kh\xF4 \u0111\u1EE9ng im l\xECm gi\u1EEFa m\xE0n
            b\u1EE5i m\u1ECFng, thi tho\u1EA3ng ch\u1EC9 rung l\xEAn khi m\u1ED9t
            c\u01A1n gi\xF3 n\xF3ng l\u01B0\u1EDBt qua."
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 1
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: 
          text: "Xa h\u01A1n n\u1EEFa, th\u1EA5p tho\xE1ng sau nh\u1EEFng ng\u1ECDn
            c\xE2y l\xE0 nh\u1EEFng d\xE3y n\xFAi \u0111\xE1 \u0111\u1ECF\nLunen
            ch\u1EADm r\xE3i b\u01B0\u1EDBc tr\xEAn con \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng m\xF2n.\nChi\u1EBFc
            v\xF2ng ng\u1ECDc n\u1EB1m y\xEAn tr\xEAn c\u1ED5 tay c\u1EADu, ph\u1EA3n
            chi\u1EBFu \xE1nh n\u1EAFng th\xE0nh m\u1ED9t v\u1EC7t s\xE1ng xanh nh\u1EA1t.\nTinh
            linh nh\u1ECF bay b\xEAn c\u1EA1nh, hai tay ch\u1ED1ng sau \u0111\u1EA7u."
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 1
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: 
          text: "Ch\xFAng ta \u0111\xE3 \u0111i theo ph\u1EA3n \u1EE9ng c\u1EE7a
            chi\u1EBFc v\xF2ng ng\u1ECDc su\u1ED1t ba ng\xE0y r\u1ED3i.\nC\u1EADu
            c\xF3 ch\u1EAFc t\xEDn hi\u1EC7u ph\xE1t ra t\u1EEB h\u01B0\u1EDBng n\xE0y
            kh\xF4ng?"
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 1
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: 
          text: "Lunen kh\xF4ng tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi ngay.\nC\u1EADu \u0111\u01B0a tay
            l\xEAn, kh\u1EBD ch\u1EA1m v\xE0o chi\u1EBFc v\xF2ng.\nM\u1EB7t ng\u1ECDc
            l\u1EA1nh ng\u1EAFt.\nNh\u01B0ng \u1EDF s\xE2u b\xEAn trong n\xF3, m\u1ED9t
            tia s\xE1ng m\u1EDD \u0111ang ch\u1EDBp t\u1EAFt."
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 1
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: Lunen
          text: "Tin t\u1EDB \u0111i , t\u1EDB c\u1EA3m nh\u1EADn c\xF3 g\xEC \u0111\xF3
            t\u1EEB vi\xEAn ng\u1ECDc n\xE0y d\u1EABn d\u1EAFt t\u1EDB theo h\u01B0\u1EDBng
            n\xE0y m\xE0"
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 0
          dimRight: 1
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: Tinh Linh
          text: "Th\u1EADt k\u1EF3 l\u1EA1, n\u01A1i n\xE0y c\u1EE9 nh\u01B0 m\xEA
            cung v\u1EADy, ch\xFAng ta \u0111i m\xE3i r\u1ED3i kh\xF4ng th\u1EA5y
            l\u1ED1i ra \u1EDF \u0111\xE2u c\u1EA3, khu r\u1EEBng n\xE0y th\u1EADt
            k\u1EF3 l\u1EA1 \u2026."
