            t\u1EEB b\u1EE5i c\xE2y b\xEAn tr\xE1i.\nX\xE0o x\u1EA1c.\nC\u1EA3 hai
            c\xF9ng d\u1EEBng l\u1EA1i.\nTinh linh nghi\xEAng \u0111\u1EA7u."
