        - speaker: 
          text: "Tinh linh v\u1EEBa \u0111\u1ECBnh \u0111\u01B0a tay ra hi\u1EC7u
            cho Lunen ti\u1EBFn th\xEAm m\u1ED9t b\u01B0\u1EDBc th\xEC m\u0169i gi\xE0y
            c\u1EE7a c\u1EADu v\xF4 t\xECnh ch\u1EA1m ph\u1EA3i m\u1ED9t c\xE0nh
