        - speaker: 
          text: "Lunen nh\xECn tinh linh. C\u1EA3 hai \u0111\u1EC1u hi\u1EC3u r\u1EB1ng
            h\u1ECD \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECB ph\xE1t hi\u1EC7n. C\u1EADu ch\u1EADm r\xE3i
            b\u01B0\u1EDBc ra kh\u1ECFi t\xE1n c\xE2y, hai tay \u0111\u1EC3 nguy\xEAn
            b\xEAn ng\u01B0\u1EDDi nh\u1EB1m cho th\u1EA5y m\xECnh kh\xF4ng c\xF3
            \xFD \u0111\u1ECBnh t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng. C\u1EADu v\u1EEBa b\u01B0\u1EDBc
            ra kh\u1ECFi t\xE1n c\xE2y th\xEC ng\u01B0\u1EDDi thi\u1EBFu ni\xEAn
            tr\u01B0\u1EDBc m\u1EB7t \u0111\xE3 lao t\u1EDBi."
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
