              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: 
          text: "L\u01B0\u1EE1i ki\u1EBFm mang theo ng\u1ECDn l\u1EEDa \u0111\u1ECF
            r\u1EF1c x\xE9 th\u1EB3ng qua kho\u1EA3ng kh\xF4ng.\nLunen l\u1EADp t\u1EE9c
            nghi\xEAng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi tr\xE1nh \u0111\xF2n. M\u1ED9t ti\u1EBFng
            \u1EA7m vang l\xEAn khi l\u01B0\u1EE1i ki\u1EBFm ch\xE9m xu\u1ED1ng n\u1EC1n
            \u0111\u1EA5t, ng\u1ECDn l\u1EEDa b\u1EAFn tung nh\u1EEFng m\u1EA3nh
            \u0111\u1EA5t kh\xF4 v\xE0 l\xE1 v\u1EE5n xung quanh."
