        - speaker: 
          text: "Lunen kh\xF4ng k\u1ECBp tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi. Thi\u1EBFu ni\xEAn \u0111\xE3
            xoay ng\u01B0\u1EDDi, \u0111\xF2n t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng th\u1EE9 hai l\u1EADp
            t\u1EE9c n\u1ED1i ti\u1EBFp. Nh\u1EEFng \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng ki\u1EBFm
            nhanh v\xE0 d\u1EE9t kho\xE1t, kh\xF4ng h\u1EC1 c\xF3 ch\xFAt th\u0103m
            d\xF2. M\u1ED7i \u0111\xF2n \u0111\u1EC1u mang theo s\u1EE9c n\xF3ng
            d\u1EEF d\u1ED9i, \xE9p Lunen li\xEAn t\u1EE5c l\xF9i l\u1EA1i gi\u1EEFa
            nh\u1EEFng th\xE2n c\xE2y."
