        - speaker: 
          text: "R\xF5 r\xE0ng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi tr\u01B0\u1EDBc m\u1EB7t kh\xF4ng
            ph\u1EA3i m\u1ED9t k\u1EBB ch\u1EC9 bi\u1EBFt d\u1EF1a v\xE0o th\xE2n
            ph\u1EADn cao qu\xFD. C\xE1ch c\u1EADu di chuy\u1EC3n cho th\u1EA5y m\u1ED9t
            qu\xE1 tr\xECnh r\xE8n luy\u1EC7n nghi\xEAm kh\u1EAFc; t\u1EEBng b\u01B0\u1EDBc
            ch\xE2n \u0111\u1EC1u ch\u1EAFc ch\u1EAFn, t\u1EEBng \u0111\xF2n \u0111\xE1nh
            \u0111\u1EC1u nh\u1EAFm v\xE0o nh\u1EEFng kho\u1EA3ng tr\u1ED1ng trong
            ph\xF2ng th\u1EE7 c\u1EE7a \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng."
