        - speaker: 
          text: "L\u1EA7n n\xE0y thi\u1EBFu ni\xEAn kh\xF4ng tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi. Ng\u1ECDn
            l\u1EEDa \u0111\xE3 b\xF9ng l\xEAn quanh v\u0169 kh\xED c\u1EE7a c\u1EADu.\n\u0110\xE1m
            ma v\u1EADt \u0111\u1ED3ng lo\u1EA1t lao t\u1EDBi.\nLunen c\u0169ng l\u1EADp
            t\u1EE9c nh\u1EADp tr\u1EADn."
