            title: "Combat - combat k\u1EBFt th\xFAc"
            summary: "hi\u1EC3n th\u1ECB win, sau khi quay l\u1EA1i panel storymode
              s\u1EBD ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c ch\u01B0\u01A1ng 1 c\u1EA3nh 2."
            beats:
            - speaker: 
              text: "Cu\u1ED9c chi\u1EBFn k\xE9o d\xE0i th\xEAm kh\xF4ng l\xE2u.\nCon
                ma v\u1EADt cu\u1ED1i c\xF9ng lao t\u1EDBi trong ti\u1EBFng g\u1EA7m
                gi\u1EADn d\u1EEF, nh\u01B0ng thi\u1EBFu ni\xEAn ch\u1EC9 xoay c\u1ED5
                tay. M\u1ED9t \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng l\u1EEDa \u0111\u1ECF r\u1EF1c
                c\u1EAFt ngang kh\xF4ng kh\xED."
