                \xE2m \u1EC9 tr\xEAn m\u1EB7t \u0111\u1EA5t. Kh\xF3i m\u1ECFng len
                qua nh\u1EEFng th\xE2n c\xE2y, h\xF2a v\xE0o \xE1nh chi\u1EC1u t\xE0
                \u0111ang d\u1EA7n chuy\u1EC3n sang m\xE0u \u0111\u1ECF s\u1EABm.\nThi\u1EBFu
                ni\xEAn thu v\u0169 kh\xED.\nSau m\u1ED9t tho\xE1ng im l\u1EB7ng,
