            - speaker: 
              text: "\xC1nh m\u1EAFt thi\u1EBFu ni\xEAn d\u1EEBng tr\xEAn Lunen l\xE2u
                h\u01A1n m\u1ED9t ch\xFAt. C\xF3 v\u1EBB c\u1EADu v\u1EABn ch\u01B0a
