            - speaker: ???
              text: "Ta v\u1ED1n ngh\u0129 nh\u1EEFng k\u1EBB l\xE9n l\xFAt xu\u1EA5t
                hi\u1EC7n trong r\u1EEBng s\u1EBD kh\xF4ng c\xF3 th\u1EF1c l\u1EF1c
                g\xEC \u0111\xE1ng k\u1EC3. Kh\xF4ng ng\u1EDD l\xFAc giao \u0111\u1EA5u
