                m_PersistentCalls:
                  m_Calls: []
            - speaker: 
              text: "Thi\u1EBFu ni\xEAn b\u1EADt c\u01B0\u1EDDi nh\u1EB9.\nSau \u0111\xF3
                c\u1EADu quay ng\u01B0\u1EDDi v\u1EC1 ph\xEDa kho\u1EA3ng tr\u1ED1ng
                ph\xEDa cu\u1ED1i khu r\u1EEBng.\nLunen nh\xECn theo."
              background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
              leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
              rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
              dimLeft: 1
              dimRight: 1
              layoutMode: 0
              instantLayout: 0
              castActions: []
              characterPlacements: []
              characterMovements: []
              characterVisuals: []
              onBeatStarted:
                m_PersistentCalls:
                  m_Calls: []
            - speaker: 
              text: "Qua nh\u1EEFng t\xE1n c\xE2y \u0111ang d\u1EA7n th\u01B0a \u0111i,
                m\u1ED9t v\xF9ng \u0111\u1EA5t r\u1ED9ng l\u1EDBn hi\u1EC7n ra tr\u01B0\u1EDBc
                m\u1EAFt. Sa m\u1EA1c tr\u1EA3i d\xE0i \u0111\u1EBFn t\u1EADn ch\xE2n
                tr\u1EDDi, nhu\u1ED9m \u0111\u1ECF d\u01B0\u1EDBi \xE1nh ho\xE0ng
                h\xF4n. Gi\u1EEFa bi\u1EC3n c\xE1t \u1EA5y l\xE0 nh\u1EEFng b\u1EE9c
                t\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111\xE1 v\xE0ng kh\u1ED5ng l\u1ED3, nh\u1EEFng
                m\xE1i v\xF2m cao v\xE0 c\xE1c t\xF2a th\xE1p \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
                ch\u1EA1m kh\u1EAFc b\u1EB1ng nh\u1EEFng bi\u1EC3u t\u01B0\u1EE3ng
                m\u1EB7t tr\u1EDDi. Xa nh\u1EA5t, m\u1ED9t qu\u1EA7n th\u1EC3 cung
                \u0111i\u1EC7n v\u01B0\u01A1n l\xEAn kh\u1ECFi th\xE0nh ph\u1ED1,
                r\u1EF1c s\xE1ng nh\u01B0 m\u1ED9t ng\u1ECDn l\u1EEDa kh\u1ED5ng
                l\u1ED3 gi\u1EEFa \u0111\u1EA5t tr\u1EDDi."
              background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
              leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
              rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
              dimLeft: 1
              dimRight: 1
