            - speaker: 
              text: "Elio \u0111\u01B0a tay xoa \u0111\u1EA7u n\xF3, r\u1ED3i nh\xECn
                Lunen v\xE0 tinh linh th\xEAm m\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n n\u1EEFa. Sau nh\u1EEFng
                g\xEC v\u1EEBa x\u1EA3y ra, s\u1EF1 c\u1EA3nh gi\xE1c ban \u0111\u1EA7u
                trong m\u1EAFt c\u1EADu \u0111\xE3 gi\u1EA3m \u0111i r\xF5 r\u1EC7t.
                Lunen kh\xF4ng ch\u1EC9 kh\xF4ng c\xF3 \xFD \u0111\u1ECBnh g\xE2y
                h\u1EA1i, m\xE0 c\xF2n v\u1EEBa ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u1ED9ng \u0111\u1EE1
                m\u1ED9t \u0111\xF2n t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng cho c\u1EADu. Ngay c\u1EA3
