    - id: chapter_1_stage_2
      title: "Con \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng v\xE0o Ho\xE0ng cung"
      description: "Rashad \u0111\u01B0a Lunen v\xE0 Tinh Linh v\xE0o ho\xE0ng cung
        Akherat, gi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u l\u1ECBch s\u1EED H\u1ECFa th\u1EA7n v\xE0
        h\xE9 l\u1ED9 s\u1EF1 c\u0103ng th\u1EB3ng trong cung."
      preview: {fileID: 0}
      energyCost: 10
      preBattleDialogue:
        id: chapter_1_stage_2_story
        title: "Con \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng v\xE0o Ho\xE0ng cung"
        summary: "Rashad \u0111\u01B0a Lunen v\xE0 Tinh Linh v\xE0o ho\xE0ng cung
          Akherat, gi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u l\u1ECBch s\u1EED H\u1ECFa th\u1EA7n v\xE0
          h\xE9 l\u1ED9 s\u1EF1 c\u0103ng th\u1EB3ng trong cung."
        beats:
        - speaker: "Ch\u01B0\u01A1ng 1"
          text: "Quest: Ng\u1ECDn L\u1EEDa D\u01B0\u1EDBi M\u1EB7t Tr\u1EDDi Sa M\u1EA1c"
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 0
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: "C\u1EA3nh 2"
          text: "Con \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng v\xE0o Ho\xE0ng cung"
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 0
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: 
          text: "Con \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng t\u1EEB khu r\u1EEBng d\u1EABn v\xE0o Ho\xE0ng
            th\xE0nh Akherat r\u1ED9ng d\u1EA7n theo t\u1EEBng b\u01B0\u1EDBc ch\xE2n.
            Nh\u1EEFng t\xE1n c\xE2y th\u01B0a \u0111i, nh\u01B0\u1EDDng ch\u1ED7
            cho nh\u1EEFng b\u1EE9c t\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111\xE1 m\xE0u v\xE0ng s\u1EABm
            tr\u1EA3i d\xE0i gi\u1EEFa bi\u1EC3n c\xE1t. Khi m\u1EB7t tr\u1EDDi b\u1EAFt
            \u0111\u1EA7u nghi\xEAng v\u1EC1 ph\xEDa ch\xE2n tr\u1EDDi, c\u1EA3 th\xE0nh
            ph\u1ED1 nh\u01B0 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ph\u1EE7 m\u1ED9t l\u1EDBp \xE1nh
            s\xE1ng \u0111\u1ECF cam r\u1EF1c r\u1EE1."
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 1
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: 
          text: "Tr\xEAn \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111i, Elio kh\xF4ng c\xF2n gi\u1EEF
            v\u1EBB \u0111\u1EC1 ph\xF2ng nh\u01B0 l\xFAc \u0111\u1EA7u. C\u1EADu
            v\u1EEBa \u0111i v\u1EEBa tr\xF2 chuy\u1EC7n v\u1EDBi Lunen v\u1EC1 nh\u1EEFng
            chuy\u1EC7n v\u1EE5n v\u1EB7t, th\u1EC9nh tho\u1EA3ng c\xF2n ph\u1EA3i
            quay sang ng\u0103n con m\xE8o tr\xEAn vai \u0111\u1ECBnh nh\u1EA3y xu\u1ED1ng
            ngh\u1ECBch m\u1ED9t th\u1EE9 g\xEC \u0111\xF3 ven \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng.\nTinh
            linh bay b\xEAn c\u1EA1nh, v\u1EABn ch\u01B0a ho\xE0n to\xE0n qu\xEAn
            chuy\u1EC7n v\u1EEBa x\u1EA3y ra."
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 1
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: Tinh Linh
          text: "C\u1EADu th\u1EADt s\u1EF1 th\u01B0\u1EDDng xuy\xEAn t\u1EF1 m\xECnh
            \u0111i v\xE0o khu r\u1EEBng nh\u01B0 v\u1EADy \xE0?"
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 0
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: Elio
          text: "\u1EEA. Ta kh\xF4ng th\xEDch l\xFAc n\xE0o c\u0169ng c\xF3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
            \u0111i theo."
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 0
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: Tinh Linh
          text: "Nh\u01B0ng c\u1EADu l\xE0 ho\xE0ng t\u1EED m\xE0."
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 0
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: 
          text: "Elio h\u01A1i nh\u01B0\u1EDBng m\xE0y."
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 1
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: Elio
          text: "Ho\xE0ng t\u1EED th\xEC kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111i d\u1EA1o
            sao?"
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 0
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: Tinh Linh
          text: "\u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c ch\u1EE9. Nh\u01B0ng ho\xE0ng t\u1EED b\xECnh
            th\u01B0\u1EDDng ch\u1EAFc kh\xF4ng v\u1EEBa \u0111i d\u1EA1o v\u1EEBa
            ch\xE9m ma v\u1EADt \u0111\xE2u."
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 0
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: 
          text: "Lunen kh\u1EBD b\u1EADt c\u01B0\u1EDDi. Elio c\u0169ng ch\u1EC9
            c\u01B0\u1EDDi nh\u1EB9, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EE7 nh\u1EADn."
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 1
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: 
          text: "Khi ba ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u01B0\u1EDBc qua c\u1ED5ng th\xE0nh, khung
            c\u1EA3nh tr\u01B0\u1EDBc m\u1EAFt thay \u0111\u1ED5i ho\xE0n to\xE0n.
            Nh\u1EEFng con \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng r\u1ED9ng l\xE1t \u0111\xE1 tr\u1EAFng
            ch\u1EA1y th\u1EB3ng v\u1EC1 trung t\xE2m th\xE0nh ph\u1ED1, hai b\xEAn
            l\xE0 nh\u1EEFng khu ch\u1EE3, m\xE1i v\xF2m v\xE0 c\xE1c c\xF4ng tr\xECnh
            \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ch\u1EA1m kh\u1EAFc b\u1EB1ng nh\u1EEFng h\u1ECDa
            ti\u1EBFt m\u1EB7t tr\u1EDDi, l\u1EEDa v\xE0 nh\u1EEFng k\xFD t\u1EF1
            c\u1ED5. Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xE2n nh\u1EADn ra Elio \u0111\u1EC1u ch\u1EE7
            \u0111\u1ED9ng c\xFAi \u0111\u1EA7u ch\xE0o, nh\u01B0ng c\u1EADu ch\u1EC9
            g\u1EADt nh\u1EB9 \u0111\xE1p l\u1EA1i, th\u1EC9nh tho\u1EA3ng c\xF2n
            d\u1EEBng l\u1EA1i h\u1ECFi han v\xE0i ng\u01B0\u1EDDi quen."
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
