        - speaker: Tinh Linh
          text: "C\u1EADu n\xF3i nh\u1EB9 nh\xE0ng qu\xE1 \u0111\u1EA5y."
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 0
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: 
          text: "Lunen kh\xF4ng \u0111\xE1p. C\u1EADu v\u1EABn \u0111ang quan s\xE1t
            nh\u1EEFng b\u1EE9c t\u01B0\u1EE3ng \u0111\u1EE9ng d\u1ECDc hai b\xEAn
            \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng. D\u01B0\u1EDBi ch\xE2n m\u1ED7i pho t\u01B0\u1EE3ng
            \u0111\u1EC1u c\xF3 nh\u1EEFng d\xF2ng ch\u1EEF c\u1ED5 kh\u1EAFc k\xEDn
            m\u1EB7t \u0111\xE1, ghi l\u1EA1i t\xEAn tu\u1ED5i v\xE0 c\xF4ng t\xEDch
            c\u1EE7a nh\u1EEFng v\u1ECB th\u1EA7n t\u1EEBng cai qu\u1EA3n v\xF9ng
            \u0111\u1EA5t n\xE0y.\nD\u1ECDc qu\u1EA3ng tr\u01B0\u1EDDng, ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
            h\u1EA7u v\xE0 binh l\xEDnh khi nh\xECn th\u1EA5y Elio \u0111\u1EC1u
            d\u1EEBng c\xF4ng vi\u1EC7c, nghi\xEAng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi h\xE0nh l\u1EC5."
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 1
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: 
          text: "Elio d\u01B0\u1EDDng nh\u01B0 \u0111\xE3 qu\xE1 quen v\u1EDBi c\u1EA3nh
            t\u01B0\u1EE3ng \u1EA5y. C\u1EADu ch\u1EC9 g\u1EADt \u0111\u1EA7u r\u1ED3i
            ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c b\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111i.\nNgay khi h\u1ECD v\u1EEBa
            \u0111\u1EBFn g\u1EA7n c\u1EEDa l\u1EDBn c\u1EE7a cung \u0111i\u1EC7n,
            m\u1ED9t thi\u1EBFu ni\xEAn kh\xE1c \u0111\xE3 t\u1EEB b\xEAn trong b\u01B0\u1EDBc
            ra.\nC\u1EADu c\xF3 v\xF3c d\xE1ng cao, trang ph\u1EE5c g\u1ECDn g\xE0ng
            h\u01A1n Elio v\xE0 mang ki\u1EBFm b\xEAn h\xF4ng. V\u1EEBa nh\xECn th\u1EA5y
            Elio, c\u1EADu l\u1EADp t\u1EE9c d\u1EEBng l\u1EA1i, \u0111\u1EB7t m\u1ED9t
            tay tr\u01B0\u1EDBc ng\u1EF1c r\u1ED3i c\xFAi \u0111\u1EA7u."
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
