        - speaker: Elio
          text: "Rashad, ta \u0111\xE3 n\xF3i r\u1ED3i. Khi kh\xF4ng c\xF3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
            ngo\xE0i th\xEC \u0111\u1EEBng l\xE0m v\u1EADy."
