        - speaker: Elio
          text: "C\xF2n \u0111\xE2y l\xE0 Lunen v\xE0 b\u1EA1n \u0111\u1ED3ng h\xE0nh
            c\u1EE7a c\u1EADu \u1EA5y. Ta g\u1EB7p h\u1ECD \u1EDF khu r\u1EEBng ph\xEDa
            ngo\xE0i th\xE0nh."
