        - speaker: Rashad
          text: "M\u1EDDi hai v\u1ECB  \u0111i theo t\xF4i ."
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 0
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: 
          text: "B\xEAn trong cung \u0111i\u1EC7n r\u1ED9ng h\u01A1n Lunen t\u01B0\u1EDFng.
            H\xE0nh lang ch\xEDnh k\xE9o d\xE0i g\u1EA7n nh\u01B0 kh\xF4ng th\u1EA5y
            \u0111i\u1EC3m cu\u1ED1i, c\xE1c c\u1ED9t \u0111\xE1 cao \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
            kh\u1EAFc h\xECnh nh\u1EEFng ng\u1ECDn l\u1EEDa xo\u1EAFn quanh bi\u1EC3u
            t\u01B0\u1EE3ng m\u1EB7t tr\u1EDDi. \xC1nh s\xE1ng t\u1EEB nh\u1EEFng
            \xF4 c\u1EEDa cao h\u1EAFt xu\u1ED1ng n\u1EC1n \u0111\xE1 th\xE0nh t\u1EEBng
            m\u1EA3ng v\xE0ng r\u1EF1c."
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 1
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: 
          text: "Rashad \u0111i tr\u01B0\u1EDBc, th\xE1i \u0111\u1ED9 ngo\xE0i m\u1EB7t
            kh\xE1 tho\u1EA3i m\xE1i. C\u1EADu v\u1EEBa \u0111i v\u1EEBa n\xF3i s\u01A1
            qua v\u1EC1 khu v\u1EF1c d\xE0nh cho kh\xE1ch v\xE0 nh\u1EEFng n\u01A1i
            Lunen c\xF3 th\u1EC3 lui t\u1EDBi trong cung.\nNh\u01B0ng khi h\u1ECD
            \u0111\xE3 \u0111i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c g\u1EA7n n\u1EEDa h\xE0nh lang,
            xung quanh kh\xF4ng c\xF2n ng\u01B0\u1EDDi h\u1EA7u n\xE0o kh\xE1c, Rashad
            \u0111\u1ED9t nhi\xEAn d\u1EEBng b\u01B0\u1EDBc."
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 1
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: 
          text: "Lunen c\u0169ng d\u1EEBng l\u1EA1i.\nKh\xF4ng m\u1ED9t l\u1EDDi
            b\xE1o tr\u01B0\u1EDBc, Rashad xoay ng\u01B0\u1EDDi v\xE0 r\xFAt ki\u1EBFm.\nL\u01B0\u1EE1i
            ki\u1EBFm d\u1EEBng ngay tr\u01B0\u1EDBc ng\u1EF1c Lunen.\nTinh linh
            gi\u1EADt m\xECnh bay l\xF9i l\u1EA1i."
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
