        - speaker: Lunen
          text: "Ch\xFAng t\xF4i \u0111ang t\xECm hi\u1EC3u ngu\u1ED3n g\u1ED1c c\u1EE7a
            m\u1ED9t chi\u1EBFc v\xF2ng. Con m\xE8o c\u1EE7a Elio l\u1EA5y n\xF3,
            ch\xFAng t\xF4i \u0111u\u1ED5i theo r\u1ED3i t\xECnh c\u1EDD g\u1EB7p
            c\u1EADu \u1EA5y."
