        - speaker: 
          text: "Rashad nh\xECn c\u1EADu m\u1ED9t l\xFAc r\u1EA5t l\xE2u, nh\u01B0
            \u0111ang c\u1ED1 t\xECm ra m\u1ED9t d\u1EA5u hi\u1EC7u n\xF3i d\u1ED1i.\nCu\u1ED1i
            c\xF9ng, l\u01B0\u1EE1i ki\u1EBFm ch\u1EADm r\xE3i h\u1EA1 xu\u1ED1ng."
