        - speaker: 
          text: "Nh\u01B0ng c\xE1ch c\u1EADu n\xF3i khi\u1EBFn Lunen hi\u1EC3u r\xF5
            r\u1EB1ng \u0111\xF3 kh\xF4ng ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u01A1n thu\u1EA7n l\xE0
            ngh\u0129a v\u1EE5 c\u1EE7a m\u1ED9t h\u1ED9 v\u1EC7.\nKh\xF4ng kh\xED
            nhanh ch\xF3ng tr\u1EDF l\u1EA1i b\xECnh th\u01B0\u1EDDng. Rashad th\u1EADm
            ch\xED c\xF2n ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u1ED9ng h\u1ECFi xem hai ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
            c\xF3 \u0111i\u1EC1u g\xEC mu\u1ED1n bi\u1EBFt v\u1EC1 Akherat hay kh\xF4ng.\nTinh
            linh g\u1EA7n nh\u01B0 l\u1EADp t\u1EE9c gi\u01A1 tay."
