              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: Sahure
          text: "Ng\xE0i \u1EA5y l\u1EA1i t\u1EF1 m\xECnh \u0111\u01B0a ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
            l\u1EA1 v\xE0o cung sao?"
