        - speaker: Rashad
          text: "\u0110i\u1EC7n h\u1EA1 \u0111\xE3 quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh. T\xF4i
            ch\u1EC9 ph\u1EE5 tr\xE1ch \u0111\u01B0a h\u1ECD t\u1EDBi khu d\xE0nh
            cho kh\xE1ch."
