        - speaker: 
          text: "\xD4ng kh\xF4ng ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c truy h\u1ECFi.\nThay v\xE0o \u0111\xF3,
            Sahure nghi\xEAng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi sang thi\u1EBFu ni\xEAn \u0111ang \xF4m
            t\xE0i li\u1EC7u ph\xEDa sau."
