            ch\u1ED3ng gi\u1EA5y trong tay r\u1ED3i c\xFAi \u0111\u1EA7u ch\xE0o
            Rashad v\xE0 hai v\u1ECB kh\xE1ch.\nSahure c\u0169ng kh\u1EBD g\u1EADt
            \u0111\u1EA7u."
