        - speaker: Tinh Linh
          text: "C\u1EADu l\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi l\xFAc chi\u1EC1u \u0111i c\xF9ng
            v\u1ECB t\u01B0 t\u1EBF kia \u0111\xFAng kh\xF4ng? C\u1EADu l\xE0 g\xEC
            Ne ne  \u1EA5y nh\u1EC9..?"
