        - speaker: 
          text: "Cung \u0111i\u1EC7n Akherat v\u1EC1 \u0111\xEAm \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
            th\u1EAFp s\xE1ng b\u1EB1ng nh\u1EEFng \u0111\xE0i l\u1EEDa tr\u1EA3i
            d\xE0i theo h\xE0nh lang. \xC1nh s\xE1ng \u0111\u1ECF v\xE0ng ph\u1EA3n
            chi\u1EBFu tr\xEAn nh\u1EEFng b\u1EE9c ph\xF9 \u0111i\xEAu c\u1ED5, khi\u1EBFn
            nh\u1EEFng h\xECnh kh\u1EAFc v\u1EC1 c\xE1c \u0111\u1EDDi H\u1ECFa th\u1EA7n
            d\u01B0\u1EDDng nh\u01B0 \u0111ang chuy\u1EC3n \u0111\u1ED9ng theo t\u1EEBng
            b\u01B0\u1EDBc ch\xE2n."
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 1
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: 
          text: "Khi ba ng\u01B0\u1EDDi t\u1EDBi g\u1EA7n \u0111\u1EA1i \u0111i\u1EC7n,
            ti\u1EBFng nh\u1EA1c v\xE0 ti\u1EBFng tr\xF2 chuy\u1EC7n \u0111\xE3 vang
            ra t\u1EEB b\xEAn trong.\nElio \u0111ang \u0111\u1EE9ng \u1EDF c\u1EEDa
            ch\u1EDD h\u1ECD. C\u1EADu \u0111\xE3 thay trang ph\u1EE5c chi\u1EBFn
            \u0111\u1EA5u ban chi\u1EC1u b\u1EB1ng l\u1EC5 ph\u1EE5c ho\xE0ng gia
            m\xE0u \u0111en pha \u0111\u1ECF s\u1EABm, nh\u1EEFng \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng
            ch\u1EC9 v\xE0ng ch\u1EA1y d\u1ECDc c\u1ED5 \xE1o v\xE0 vai."
