        - speaker: Tinh Linh
          text: "Rashad l\xFAc chi\u1EC1u c\u1EE9 n\xF3i nh\u01B0 th\u1EC3 g\u1EB7p
            b\xE0 \u1EA5y xong th\xEC b\u1ECDn t\xF4i s\u1EBD hi\u1EC3u th\u1EBF
