        - speaker: Elio
          text: "V\xE2ng. \u0110\xE2y l\xE0 Lunen, c\xF2n \u0111\xE2y l\xE0 tinh
            linh \u0111\u1ED3ng h\xE0nh c\xF9ng c\u1EADu \u1EA5y."
