              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: Aurelian
          text: "C\xE1c v\u1ECB \u0111\xE3 l\xE0 kh\xE1ch c\u1EE7a Elio th\xEC t\u1ED1i
            nay c\u0169ng l\xE0 kh\xE1ch c\u1EE7a ho\xE0ng gia. Kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n
