        - speaker: Aurelian
          text: "Chuy\u1EC7n v\u01B0\u01A1ng t\u1EED Akherat b\u1ECB ma v\u1EADt
            t\u1EADp k\xEDch ngo\xE0i th\xE0nh, con ngh\u0129 c\xF3 th\u1EC3 kh\xF4ng
            b\xE1o cho ta?"
