        - speaker: 
          text: "Lunen h\u01A1i kh\u1EF1ng l\u1EA1i tr\u01B0\u1EDBc c\xE2u tr\u1EA3
            l\u1EDDi th\u1EB3ng th\u1EAFn \u1EA5y.\nAurelian nh\xECn sang Elio."
