        - speaker: Aurelian
          text: "Xem ra chuy\u1EBFn \u0111i ngo\xE0i th\xE0nh h\xF4m nay c\u1EE7a
            con c\u0169ng kh\xF4ng ho\xE0n to\xE0n v\xF4 \xEDch."
