        - speaker: 
          text: "Sahure \u0111\u1EE9ng th\u1EB3ng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi. \xC1nh m\u1EAFt
            \xF4ng nhanh ch\xF3ng d\u1EEBng l\u1EA1i \u1EDF Lunen v\xE0 Tinh Linh."
