        - speaker: Sahure
          text: "Xem ra hai v\u1ECB kh\xE1ch ban chi\u1EC1u c\u0169ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
            m\u1EDDi t\u1EDBi d\u1EF1 y\u1EBFn."
