            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: Aurelian
          text: "N\u1EBFu c\xE1c ng\u01B0\u01A1i nghi ng\u1EDD quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh
            \u0111\xF3, h\xE3y n\xF3i tr\u1EF1c ti\u1EBFp v\u1EDBi ta."
