            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: Aurelian
          text: "M\u1ED9t n\u01A1i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c cho l\xE0 t\u1ED3n t\u1EA1i
            b\xEAn ngo\xE0i ranh gi\u1EDBi c\u1EE7a th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi."
