              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: Aurelian
          text: "Nh\u01B0ng nh\u1EEFng g\xEC c\xF2n l\u1EA1i qu\xE1 \xEDt. Ta kh\xF4ng
            k\u1EBFt lu\u1EADn khi ch\u01B0a c\xF3 \u0111\u1EE7 ch\u1EE9ng c\u1EE9."
