        - speaker: Lunen
          text: "T\xF4i t\u01B0\u1EDFng ho\xE0ng t\u1EED ph\u1EA3i quen v\u1EDBi
            nh\u1EEFng d\u1ECBp th\u1EBF n\xE0y."
