        - speaker: Elio
          text: "L\xE0 \xFD ch\xED \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c truy\u1EC1n l\u1EA1i t\u1EEB
            c\xE1c \u0111\u1EDDi H\u1ECFa th\u1EA7n."
