        - speaker: Aurelian
          text: "Ng\u1ECDn l\u1EEDa c\u1EE7a H\u1ECFa th\u1EA7n ch\u01B0a bao gi\u1EDD
            t\u1ED3n t\u1EA1i v\xEC ngai v\u1ECB."
