        - speaker: 
          text: "R\u1EDDi kh\u1ECFi ho\xE0ng cung, b\u1ED1n ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111i
            v\u1EC1 ph\xEDa khu d\xE2n c\u01B0 ph\xEDa Nam.\nNh\u1EEFng con ph\u1ED1
            \u0111\xE3 b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c trang tr\xED b\u1EB1ng
            c\xE1c d\u1EA3i v\u1EA3i xanh v\xE0 v\xE0ng. Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xE2n d\u1EF1ng
            nh\u1EEFng \u0111\xE0i \u0111\xE1 nh\u1ECF h\xECnh gi\u1ECDt n\u01B0\u1EDBc,
            c\xF2n c\xE1c ngh\u1EC7 nh\xE2n \u0111ang ho\xE0n thi\u1EC7n nh\u1EEFng
            bi\u1EC3u t\u01B0\u1EE3ng m\u1EB7t tr\u1EDDi s\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
            treo trong ng\xE0y l\u1EC5."
