        - speaker: 
          text: "H\u1ECD ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c t\u1EDBi v\xF9ng canh t\xE1c ph\xEDa
            \u0110\xF4ng.\nNh\u1EEFng c\xE1nh \u0111\u1ED3ng kh\xF4 n\u1EE9t k\xE9o
            d\xE0i d\u01B0\u1EDBi m\u1EB7t tr\u1EDDi. M\u1ED9t s\u1ED1 lu\u1ED1ng
            c\xE2y \u0111\xE3 ch\u1EBFt ho\xE0n to\xE0n, c\xE1c k\xEAnh d\u1EABn
            n\u01B0\u1EDBc ch\u1EC9 c\xF2n l\u1EA1i m\u1ED9t d\xF2ng n\u01B0\u1EDBc
            r\u1EA5t m\u1ECFng.\nTinh Linh kh\xF4ng c\xF2n \u0111\xF9a n\u1EEFa."
