        - speaker: Elio
          text: "Nh\u01B0ng ch\u1EEBng n\xE0o Akherat v\u1EABn c\xF2n ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
            tin v\xE0o ng\u1ECDn l\u1EEDa \u1EA5y..."
