        - speaker: Elio
          text: "L\u1EDDi th\u1EC1 b\u1EA3o h\u1ED9 v\xF9ng \u0111\u1EA5t n\xE0y
            s\u1EBD v\u1EABn ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c."
