        - speaker: 
          text: "D\u01B0\u1EDBi \xE1nh chi\u1EC1u t\xE0, c\u1EA3 nh\xF3m b\u1EAFt
            \u0111\u1EA7u quay v\u1EC1 ho\xE0ng cung. Ph\xEDa sau h\u1ECD, nh\u1EEFng
            d\u1EA3i l\u1EE5a xanh tr\xEAn \u0111\xE0i t\u1EBF tung l\xEAn trong
            gi\xF3 sa m\u1EA1c.\n\u0110\u1EA1i l\u1EC5 T\u1EBF Thi\xEAn C\u1EA7u
            V\u0169 \u0111ang \u0111\u1EBFn g\u1EA7n.\nV\xE0 c\xF9ng l\xFAc \u0111\xF3,
            nh\u1EEFng b\u1EA5t \u1ED5n \u0111ang bao ph\u1EE7 Akherat c\u0169ng
