          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: Rashad
          text: "\u0110\u1ED1i v\u1EDBi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi Akherat, \u0111\xE2y l\xE0
            l\u1EDDi c\u1EA7u nguy\u1EC7n cho m\u1ED9t n\u0103m s\u1ED1ng c\xF2n."
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 0
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: 
          text: "Tinh Linh nh\xECn nh\u1EEFng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xE2n \u0111ang \u0111\u1EE9ng
            d\u01B0\u1EDBi qu\u1EA3ng tr\u01B0\u1EDDng. C\xF3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi mang
            theo b\xECnh n\u01B0\u1EDBc nh\u1ECF, c\xF3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \xF4m nh\u1EEFng
            b\xF3 l\xFAa \u0111\xE3 kh\xF4 h\xE9o, c\u0169ng c\xF3 nh\u1EEFng gia
            \u0111\xECnh mang theo v\u1EADt ph\u1EA9m t\u01B0\u1EE3ng tr\u01B0ng
            cho m\xF9a m\xE0ng."
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 1
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: Tinh Linh
          text: "V\xEC h\u1EA1n h\xE1n?"
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 0
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: 
          text: "Rashad g\u1EADt \u0111\u1EA7u."
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 1
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: Rashad
          text: "N\u0103m nay nghi l\u1EC5 mang \xFD ngh\u0129a l\u1EDBn h\u01A1n
            m\u1ECDi n\u0103m."
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 0
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: 
          text: "Ti\u1EBFng t\xF9 v\xE0 vang l\xEAn.\nTo\xE0n b\u1ED9 qu\u1EA3ng
            tr\u01B0\u1EDDng d\u1EA7n im xu\u1ED1ng.\nH\u1ED9i \u0111\u1ED3ng T\u01B0
            t\u1EBF ti\u1EBFn v\xE0o tr\u01B0\u1EDBc. Sahure \u0111i \u0111\u1EA7u,
            Nefru theo ph\xEDa sau c\xF9ng nh\u1EEFng t\u01B0 t\u1EBF tr\u1EBB kh\xE1c.\nSau
            \u0111\xF3 l\xE0 Elio."
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 1
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: 
          text: "C\u1EADu m\u1EB7c l\u1EC5 ph\u1EE5c c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u1EDDi k\u1EBF
            th\u1EEBa H\u1ECFa ch\xED, kh\xE1c h\u1EB3n trang ph\u1EE5c th\u01B0\u1EDDng
            ng\xE0y. Tr\xEAn ng\u1EF1c l\xE0 bi\u1EC3u t\u01B0\u1EE3ng H\u1ECFa \u1EA4n
            ch\u01B0a ho\xE0n ch\u1EC9nh, t\u01B0\u1EE3ng tr\u01B0ng cho ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
            \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\u1EF1a ch\u1ECDn nh\u01B0ng ch\u01B0a
            ch\xEDnh th\u1EE9c ti\u1EBFp nh\u1EADn th\u1EA7n v\u1ECB.\nTinh Linh
            ch\u1EDBp m\u1EAFt."
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 1
