            ph\xEDa sau T\u1EBF Thi\xEAn \u0110\xE0i.\nTrong m\u1ED9t kho\u1EA3nh
            kh\u1EAFc, v\u1EBB c\u0103ng th\u1EB3ng tr\xEAn khu\xF4n m\u1EB7t c\u1EADu
            d\u1ECBu xu\u1ED1ng."
