                li\xEAn t\u1EE5c cho t\u1EDBi khi l\u01B0ng ch\u1EA1m v\xE0o b\u1EE9c
                t\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111\xE1 ph\xEDa sau T\u1EBF Thi\xEAn \u0110\xE0i.\nKh\xF4ng
                c\xF2n \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng lui.\nTinh Linh nh\xECn th\u1EA5y t\u1EEB
                xa."
