            - speaker: 
              text: "Lunen c\u1ED1 ph\xE1 v\xF2ng v\xE2y.\nNh\u01B0ng kh\xF4ng k\u1ECBp.\nM\u1ED9t
                ma v\u1EADt gi\u01A1 v\u0169 kh\xED l\xEAn tr\u01B0\u1EDBc m\u1EB7t
                Elio.\nElio \u0111\u01B0a tay l\xEAn, ng\u1ECDn l\u1EEDa y\u1EBFu
