            - speaker: 
              text: "Aurelian quay \u0111i.\nElio v\u1EABn \u0111\u1EE9ng y\xEAn.\nS\u1EAFc
                m\u1EB7t c\u1EADu kh\xF4ng thay \u0111\u1ED5i nhi\u1EC1u.\nNh\u01B0ng
                Lunen nh\u1EADn ra b\xE0n tay \u0111ang n\u1EAFm chu\xF4i ki\u1EBFm
                si\u1EBFt ch\u1EB7t h\u01A1n b\xECnh th\u01B0\u1EDDng."
