            - speaker: 
              text: "Sau khi t\xECnh h\xECnh \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ki\u1EC3m so\xE1t,
                H\u1ED9i \u0111\u1ED3ng T\u01B0 t\u1EBF nhanh ch\xF3ng ki\u1EC3m
                tra T\u1EBF Thi\xEAn \u0110\xE0i."
