            - speaker: 
              text: "Aurelian ng\xE3 xu\u1ED1ng.\nNg\u1ECDn l\u1EEDa bao quanh T\u1EBF
                Thi\xEAn \u0110\xE0i l\u1EADp t\u1EE9c t\u1EAFt.\nM\u01B0a v\u1EABn
