                  m_Calls: []
            - speaker: 
              text: "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xE2n b\xEAn d\u01B0\u1EDBi b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u
                h\u1ED7n lo\u1EA1n tr\u1EDF l\u1EA1i.\nNh\u1EEFng ti\u1EBFng g\u1ECDi
                t\xEAn H\u1ECFa th\u1EA7n vang l\xEAn gi\u1EEFa m\xE0n m\u01B0a.\nNh\u01B0ng
                Aurelian kh\xF4ng t\u1EC9nh l\u1EA1i.\nElio c\xFAi \u0111\u1EA7u,
                b\xE0n tay run r\u1EA5t nh\u1EB9 khi n\u1EAFm l\u1EA5y tay b\xE0."
              background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
              leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
              rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
              dimLeft: 1
              dimRight: 1
              layoutMode: 0
              instantLayout: 0
              castActions: []
              characterPlacements: []
              characterMovements: []
              characterVisuals: []
              onBeatStarted:
                m_PersistentCalls:
                  m_Calls: []
            - speaker: 
              text: "Ch\u1EC9 v\xE0i kh\u1EAFc tr\u01B0\u1EDBc, ch\xEDnh ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
                ph\u1EE5 n\u1EEF n\xE0y c\xF2n \u0111\u1EE9ng tr\u01B0\u1EDBc c\u1EA3
                Akherat nh\u01B0 m\u1ED9t ng\u1ECDn l\u1EEDa kh\xF4ng g\xEC c\xF3
                th\u1EC3 lay chuy\u1EC3n.\nGi\u1EDD \u0111\xE2y b\xE0 \u0111ang n\u1EB1m
                b\u1EA5t \u0111\u1ED9ng tr\u01B0\u1EDBc m\u1EB7t c\u1EADu.\nElio
                nh\xECn xu\u1ED1ng."
              background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
              leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
              rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
              dimLeft: 1
              dimRight: 1
              layoutMode: 0
              instantLayout: 0
              castActions: []
              characterPlacements: []
              characterMovements: []
              characterVisuals: []
              onBeatStarted:
                m_PersistentCalls:
                  m_Calls: []
            - speaker: 
              text: "Trong \u0111\u1EA7u c\u1EADu, nh\u1EEFng l\u1EDDi Aurelian v\u1EEBa
                n\xF3i ch\u01B0a l\xE2u l\u1EA1i vang l\xEAn.\nV\u1EDBi th\u1EF1c
                l\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i, con c\xF2n qu\xE1 y\u1EBFu.\nCh\u01B0a
                \u0111\u1EE7 t\u01B0 c\xE1ch \u0111\u1EC3 tr\u1EDF th\xE0nh ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
                cai tr\u1ECB Akherat.\nElio si\u1EBFt ch\u1EB7t tay."
              background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
              leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
              rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
              dimLeft: 1
              dimRight: 1
              layoutMode: 0
              instantLayout: 0
              castActions: []
              characterPlacements: []
              characterMovements: []
              characterVisuals: []
              onBeatStarted:
                m_PersistentCalls:
                  m_Calls: []
            - speaker: 
              text: "Nh\u01B0ng l\u1EA7n n\xE0y\u2014"
              background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
              leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
              rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
              dimLeft: 1
              dimRight: 1
              layoutMode: 0
              instantLayout: 0
              castActions: []
              characterPlacements: []
              characterMovements: []
              characterVisuals: []
              onBeatStarted:
                m_PersistentCalls:
                  m_Calls: []
            - speaker: 
              text: "Kh\xF4ng c\xF2n Aurelian \u0111\u1EE9ng ph\xEDa tr\u01B0\u1EDBc
                n\u1EEFa.\n\u1EDE m\u1ED9t g\xF3c khu\u1EA5t c\u1EE7a T\u1EBF Thi\xEAn
                \u0110\xE0i, \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng k\xFD t\u1EF1 \u0111en cu\u1ED1i
                c\xF9ng ch\u1EADm r\xE3i bi\u1EBFn m\u1EA5t.\nKh\xF4ng ai nh\u1EADn
                ra r\u1EB1ng ngay tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi l\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n k\xEDch
                ho\u1EA1t...\nAurelian \u0111\xE3 nh\xECn th\u1EA5y n\xF3."
