    - id: chapter_1_stage_6
      title: "Khi ng\u1ECDn l\u1EEDa kh\xF4ng c\xF2n s\u1EF1 b\u1EA3o h\u1ED9"
      description: "Aurelian b\u1EA5t t\u1EC9nh, Elio g\xE1nh l\u1EA5y Akherat, r\u1ED3i
        bi\u1EBFn c\u1ED1 Nephkar \u0111\u1EA9y ng\u1ECDn l\u1EEDa k\u1EBF v\u1ECB
        t\u1EDBi th\u1EED th\xE1ch sinh t\u1EED."
      preview: {fileID: 0}
      energyCost: 10
      preBattleDialogue:
        id: chapter_1_stage_6_story
        title: "Khi ng\u1ECDn l\u1EEDa kh\xF4ng c\xF2n s\u1EF1 b\u1EA3o h\u1ED9"
        summary: "Aurelian b\u1EA5t t\u1EC9nh, Elio g\xE1nh l\u1EA5y Akherat, r\u1ED3i
          bi\u1EBFn c\u1ED1 Nephkar \u0111\u1EA9y ng\u1ECDn l\u1EEDa k\u1EBF v\u1ECB
          t\u1EDBi th\u1EED th\xE1ch sinh t\u1EED."
        beats:
        - speaker: "C\u1EA3nh 6"
          text: "Khi ng\u1ECDn l\u1EEDa kh\xF4ng c\xF2n s\u1EF1 b\u1EA3o h\u1ED9"
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 0
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: 
          text: "Sau \u0110\u1EA1i l\u1EC5 T\u1EBF Thi\xEAn C\u1EA7u V\u0169, Aurelian
            \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u01B0a tr\u1EDF v\u1EC1 ho\xE0ng cung.\nL\u1EDDi
            nguy\u1EC1n \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECB ng\u0103n kh\xF4ng cho ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c
            lan r\u1ED9ng, nh\u01B0ng H\u1ECFa th\u1EA7n v\u1EABn ch\xECm trong tr\u1EA1ng
            th\xE1i b\u1EA5t t\u1EC9nh.\nKh\xF4ng m\u1ED9t ng\u1EF1 y hay t\u01B0
            t\u1EBF n\xE0o c\xF3 th\u1EC3 x\xE1c \u0111\u1ECBnh khi n\xE0o b\xE0
            s\u1EBD t\u1EC9nh l\u1EA1i."
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 1
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: 
          text: "\u0110\u1EA1i \u0111i\u1EC7n Akherat ch\u01B0a bao gi\u1EDD y\xEAn
            t\u0129nh \u0111\u1EBFn v\u1EADy.\nNgai v\xE0ng v\u1EABn \u1EDF \u0111\xF3.\nNh\u01B0ng
            l\u1EA7n \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn k\u1EC3 t\u1EEB khi Lunen t\u1EDBi Akherat,
            Aurelian kh\xF4ng ng\u1ED3i tr\xEAn n\xF3.\nElio \u0111\u1EE9ng ph\xEDa
            d\u01B0\u1EDBi ngai, tr\u01B0\u1EDBc m\u1EB7t l\xE0 H\u1ED9i \u0111\u1ED3ng
            T\u01B0 t\u1EBF v\xE0 c\xE1c \u0111\u1EA1i th\u1EA7n."
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 1
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: "T\u01B0 t\u1EBF 1"
          text: "B\u1EC7 h\u1EA1 ch\u01B0a th\u1EC3 t\u1EC9nh l\u1EA1i. Tri\u1EC1u
            \u0111\xECnh kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c tr\xEC ho\xE3n vi\u1EC7c
            \u0111i\u1EC1u h\xE0nh."
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
          leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
          dimLeft: 1
          dimRight: 0
          layoutMode: 0
          instantLayout: 0
          castActions: []
          characterPlacements: []
          characterMovements: []
          characterVisuals: []
          onBeatStarted:
            m_PersistentCalls:
              m_Calls: []
        - speaker: "\u0110\u1EA1i th\u1EA7n"
          text: "Nh\u01B0ng \u0110i\u1EC7n h\u1EA1 v\u1EABn ch\u01B0a ti\u1EBFp nh\u1EADn
            H\u1ECFa \u1EA4n."
