        - speaker: Sahure
          text: "N\u1EBFu c\xE1c v\u1ECB mu\u1ED1n ch\u1EA5t v\u1EA5n quy\u1EBFt
            \u0111\u1ECBnh c\u1EE7a H\u1ECFa th\u1EA7n..."
