        - speaker: Sahure
          text: "\u0110\xE1ng l\u1EBD n\xEAn l\xE0m khi Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi c\xF2n t\u1EC9nh
            \u0111\u1EC3 t\u1EF1 m\xECnh tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi."
