        - speaker: 
          text: "B\xE1o c\xE1o v\u1EC1 ngu\u1ED3n n\u01B0\u1EDBc.\nPh\xE2n ph\u1ED1i
            l\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EF1c.\nNh\u1EEFng v\u1EE5 m\u1EA5t t\xEDch.\nQu\xE2n
            \u0111\u1ED9i \u1EDF bi\xEAn gi\u1EDBi."
