        - speaker: Elio
          text: "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn h\u1ECD \u0111em ta ra so
            s\xE1nh v\u1EABn l\xE0 Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi."
          background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44117fbeb6b31014ea4da2b5af930269, type: 3}
