        - speaker: 
          text: "Chi\u1EBFc v\xF2ng tr\xEAn tay \u0111\u1ED9t nhi\xEAn n\xF3ng l\xEAn.\nNh\u1EEFng
            k\xFD t\u1EF1 tr\xEAn m\u1EB7t v\xF2ng ph\xE1t s\xE1ng.\nM\u1ED9t v\u1EBFt
            n\u1EE9t r\u1EA5t nh\u1ECF xu\u1EA5t hi\u1EC7n tr\xEAn b\u1EE9c t\u01B0\u1EDDng
            l\u1EEDa.\nLunen nh\xECn n\xF3."
