            - speaker: Lunen
              text: "C\u1EADu \u1EA5y mu\u1ED1n h\u1ECFi \xFD ki\u1EBFn \xF4ng v\u1EC1
                vi\u1EC7c r\xE8n m\u1ED9t v\u0169 kh\xED m\u1EDBi."
