              onBeatStarted:
                m_PersistentCalls:
                  m_Calls: []
            - speaker: 
              text: "Elio kh\xF4ng bi\u1EBFt \u0111\xF3 l\xE0 l\u1EDDi m\u1EC9a mai
                hay l\u1EDDi khuy\xEAn.\nSahure c\u0169ng kh\xF4ng gi\u1EA3i th\xEDch."
