          v\u1EADt c\u1ED1 \u0111\u1ECBnh l\xE0 elio, 1 l\xE0 Khepraen. enemy c\xF3
          1 con boss t\xEAn l\xE0 Nephkar. c\u01A1 ch\u1EBF c\u1EE7a boss: tri\u1EC7u
          h\u1ED3i qu\xE1i con. max l\xE0 2 con, th\u1EDDi gian h\u1ED3i skill tri\u1EC7u
          h\u1ED3i l\xE0 5 turn t\u1EE9c l\xE0 5 turn m\u1EDBi \u0111\xE1nh 1 l\u1EA7n.
          l\u01B0\u1EE3t \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn l\xE0 c\u1EE7a boss, l\u1EADp t\u1EE9c
          tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i 2 con qu\xE1i. t\u1ED1i \u0111a ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 2 con
          qu\xE1i con c\xF3 m\u1EB7t tr\xEAn s\xE2n. ch\u1EC9 s\u1ED1 qu\xE1i con
          th\u1EA5p. boss kh\xF4ng c\xF3 chi\xEAu g\xE2y damage ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 tri\u1EC7u
          h\u1ED3i."
