        - speaker: 
          text: "Menkara \xF4m m\u1ED9t quy\u1EC3n s\xE1ch tr\u01B0\u1EDBc ng\u1EF1c.\nRamesses
            v\xE0 Kasim c\u0169ng \u0111ang \u0111\u1EE9ng c\xF9ng m\u1ED9t nh\xF3m
            nh\u1ECF h\u1ED9 v\u1EC7.\nElio nh\xECn v\u1EBB m\u1EB7t hai ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
            r\u1ED3i b\u1EADt c\u01B0\u1EDDi."
